    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set in a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking the picturesque River Moy, this quaint two-bedroom semi-detached residence offers peace, comfort, and modern living in an idyllic setting. Located just a short stroll from Foxford town and its many amenities, and approximately 16km from Ballina, the property perfectly blends convenience with countryside tranquility. \r\n\r\nSituated adjacent to the River Moy, famous for its salmon fishing, —making it a true haven for fishing enthusiasts, the home is surrounded by mature trees and lush greenery, and thoughtfully designed with a reverse floor plan to maximise the spectacular river and countryside vistas. The upper floor features an inviting open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area — flooded with natural light and framing stunning river views. The kitchen boasts maple units, quality appliances, and a feature solid fuel stove for added warmth and coziness.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, you’ll find two comfortable bedrooms and a well-appointed bathroom with bath and overhead shower, creating a peaceful retreat. To the rear, a private garden with direct access to the river offers a unique opportunity to enjoy outdoor relaxation in a tranquil, natural setting.\r\n\r\nThis modern, energy-efficient home qualifies for the Help to Buy Scheme, making it ideal for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or as a shrewd investment property.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this charming riverside home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Charming 2-Bedroom Semi-Detached Residence with Stunning River Moy Views\r\n-Constructed in 2006, consisting of c. 78 sqm\r\n-Walking distance to all town amenities \r\n-Reverse floor plan\r\n-Off street parking \r\n-Scenic walks located nearby\r\n-Ideal starter home or investment property\r\n-Private garden to the rear\r\n-Gas fired central heating"
      },
      {
